VRM files exported by OpenSculptBoy

  opensculptboy export writes VRM avatars (opensculptboy.export.vrm). Each file credits the
  parts it is built from, in meta.thirdPartyLicenses (VRM 1.0) or meta.reference (VRM 0.x):
  OpenSculptBoy and the Anny body model (Apache License, Version 2.0), the MakeHuman and MPFB2
  assets and the Face Units (CC0 1.0), and ICT-FaceKit (MIT licence) for the detail face shapes.
  The licence and permission fields of a file (who may use the avatar, and for what) are set by
  the person who exports it, through --author and --meta; they start restrictive. VRM 0.x files
  link to this file as their otherPermissionUrl.

Not part of the package

