  (anny.paths.download_noncommercial_data) when a model uses the "smpl" or "smplx" topology or
  the SMPL and SMPLX wrapper classes. It is licensed for non-commercial use only. See the
  LICENSE.txt and NOTICE.txt files inside the downloaded archive. The "anny", "makehuman" and
  "soma" topologies do not fetch it.
